# NOTE: media/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Each Render deploy starts from a
# fresh checkout, so images committed here are present again after every deploy
# and are served by the /media/ route. Images uploaded through Django Admin are
# NOT in git - see "Uploaded images" in README.md to make those permanent too.
